nal}_S,\\mathrm{Ordinal},\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的最小等势序数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality.md\">58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}boundedness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\omega\\subseteq\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\n\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\n\\land\\beta\\subseteq\\lambda\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\kappa,\\lambda)\n\\land\n\\left|\\{\\alpha\\in\\kappa:f(\\alpha)\\in\\beta\\}\\right|=\\kappa\n\\to\n\\bigcup\\{\\alpha\\cup\\{\\alpha\\}:\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\land f(\\alpha)\\in\\beta\\}\n=\\kappa.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}boundedness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\omega\\subseteq\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\n\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\n\\land\\beta\\subseteq\\lambda\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\kappa,\\lambda)\n\\land\n\\left|\\{\\alpha\\in\\kappa:f(\\alpha)\\in\\beta\\}\\right|=\\kappa\n\\to\n\\bigcup\\{\\alpha\\cup\\{\\alpha\\}:\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\land f(\\alpha)\\in\\beta\\}\n=\\kappa.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>该断言对任意无限基数成立；没有增加原断言未要求的正则性。</li>\n<li>It relates to stationary sets and colorings.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 ·